0486353521798264_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HLirjjFaYcsQ7kNvwG-Pd9p&_nc_oc=Adrdg1iJDr9ZOgXgzoU9nblrfMtZ56cqZhdUDTs5VPtgbBZOQ4dW5Hyj8R-PzdefPGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJOsYoJLDy9YK67PNEcM6rSUnIp3EZGPzh4ZX7BBPY0kg&oe=6AB27C13"}, {"file_name": "Food_Serving.png", "id": "1846673312725781", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831964_1846673316059114_831992244305948436_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=54xXhghGiOsQ7kNvwH83NP7&_nc_oc=Adok69tKjW6hDnPSJ-ST7l-FITyFG_ep7UxLlXRBp0t9I71w4bk72BH29vM1UVrAI3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKp75RkufivkQJ2HzfSHc-ddQ3DUz5VT5LQUfljXRDp9Q&oe=6AB2976A"}, {"file_name": "Shop.png", "id": "1226870236131683", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619074_1226870239465016_4184252460972799649_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-nUBfCoSjfMQ7kNvwGJdEVe&_nc_oc=AdqHHPq3a-tG8MqC4MuhYuy9A5_5HW7PqaWimXJrTgcpsLedXjw0krem9Nw5xXW8H2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLiSD99v7G-9ADVZI4Zjdi2i3o4tx0M30pVUh_GwqMSAg&oe=6AB2A6D3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Food Ninja Shop Simulator", "keywords": ["cooking", "slice", "food", "recipes", "cook"], "long_description": "# Step into the World of Food Ninja Shop Simulator!\nUnleash your inner ninja in this immersive VR game. Slice fruits, upgrade your tools, and unlock exciting new challenges in Food Ninja Shop Simulator on VR!\n\n**Cutting Fruit:**\n\nSlice through various fruits in the VR world with sharp precision. Master your skills in this immersive fruit-slicing experience!\n{708254775617881}\n\n\n**Cutting with Axe:**\n\nSwing the axe and cut through large fruits in this action-packed VR experience. Use your strength and accuracy to become a slicing master!\n{1169096235408829}\n\n**Unlocking Fruit:**\n\nUnlock new fruits and increase the excitement as 